# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the asan preset: leaks inside the GPU driver only (CLAUDE.md, "Warnings").
# A frame of ours in the stack is never a reason to add a line here. Driver libraries are often unloaded
# by exit time (their frames print as <unknown module>), so lines name the GLFW function that called in.
#
# Mesa: glXQueryExtensionsString during GLFW's GLX initialisation keeps 128 bytes for the process lifetime.
leak:_glfwInitGLX
# Named drivers, for when their frames do resolve.
leak:radeonsi_dri.so
leak:libgallium
leak:libnvidia-
leak:libGLX_mesa.so
